     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Dear\r\nall,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I’d like\r\nto constrain all error variances to be positive. Therefore, I used the following\r\nmodel syntax:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">m2\r\n&lt;- &#39;inhib =~ antisaccade + stopsignal + colorstroop + simon + numberstroop +\r\narrowflanker</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                </span># constraints</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                </span>antisaccade ~~ b1*antisaccade</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                </span>stopsignal ~~ b2*stopsignal</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                </span>colorstroop ~~ b3*colorstroop</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                </span>simon ~~ b4*simon</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                </span>numberstroop ~~ b5*numberstroop</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                </span>arrowflanker ~~ b6*arrowflanker</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                </span>b1 &gt; 0</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                </span>b2 &gt; 0</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                </span>b3 &gt; 0</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                </span>b4 &gt; 0</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                </span>b5 &gt; 0</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                </span>b6 &gt; 0&#39;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">fit2\r\n&lt;- sem(m2, data=d, <a href=\"http://std.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://std.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792417036835000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0-oPORoteRLShUI7pLiDbI\">std.lv</a> = TRUE)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">summary(fit2,\r\nstandardized = TRUE)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=